title: "An Identification Key for Agent Failures"
authors:
  - family-names: Kosturko
    given-names: Jessica
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-21
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/jkosturko/agent-failure-key"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  An identification key for 36 failure modes in AI-orchestrated agent
  systems - the failures that appear when language models are wired to
  tools, schedules, workflows, persistent state, and each other, and
  that pass ordinary pass/fail checks. Built from logged incidents on
  one continuously instrumented fleet and cross-referenced with current
  academic research. A field guide, not an industry frequency survey.
